
Formatted fields expand to literal tokens, so they can be passed as
arguments and their content is not subject to further expansion.

@
def upper(body):
    for token in body:
        yield tproc.LiteralToken(token.content.upper())

@braces
\{x\}

@main
{upper::{title:*^9}} {braces:>6}

@title
abc

@expected
***ABC***    \{x\}
